{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-024",
    "title": "沈砚秋的证词"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_128",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“顾氏有人同意，有人拒绝。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯照着来时的路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4023,
          "end": 4023
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临和顾长离沿雪线返回旧驿道，叶观澜走在最后。他们没有回到无灯镇，而是在一处塌毁的石桥下停住。灯光在雪地上铺开一条青白色的线，线的尽头指向北侧山谷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4025,
          "end": 4025
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那里有什么？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4027,
          "end": 4027
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看着山谷：“顾氏旧库。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4029,
          "end": 4029
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你以前来过？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4031,
          "end": 4031
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“小时候来过一次。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4033,
          "end": 4033
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记得路吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4035,
          "end": 4035
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我记得入口，不记得里面。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4037,
          "end": 4037
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜在旁边笑了一声：“借火的代价来得很快。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4039,
          "end": 4039
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有理会。他掌心残印的空白比昨夜更大，像有人从里面挖走了一小块。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4041,
          "end": 4041
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾长离，顾氏旁支第七代，继承未偿债一笔。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4067,
          "end": 4067
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向她：“你出生之后就有债？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4069,
          "end": 4069
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏的债不按出生算，按印记算。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4071,
          "end": 4071
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是什么债？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4073,
          "end": 4073
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离翻到下一页。页上写着：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4075,
          "end": 4075
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“以一名后代的修行根基，偿还一盏未归之灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4077,
          "end": 4077
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的手指停住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4079,
          "end": 4079
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以你不能突破筑基？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4081,
          "end": 4081
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是不能，是每突破一层，债契便会从家族记忆里取走一个名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4083,
          "end": 4083
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜走近查看：“这不是债契，是封存术的附录。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4085,
          "end": 4085
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏把它叫债。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4087,
          "end": 4087
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为债比术更容易让人服从。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4089,
          "end": 4089
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把薄册翻到最后。最后一页有三处手印：顾氏、玄霄宗、归墟盟。三方印记下方写着同一句话：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4091,
          "end": 4091
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“经手人不得拒绝第二次点灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4093,
          "end": 4093
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想起顾长离叔父将第二盏灯送回无灯镇的影像。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4095,
          "end": 4095
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他拒绝过？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4097,
          "end": 4097
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以才把债传给后代。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4099,
          "end": 4099
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你家族知道他还活着吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4101,
          "end": 4101
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们说他死在灵脉城。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4103,
          "end": 4103
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离合上薄册，神情平静得近乎冷漠。她将旧印收回袖中，却没有把薄册放下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4105,
          "end": 4105
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你要带走它？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4107,
          "end": 4107
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是我唯一能证明顾氏说谎的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4109,
          "end": 4109
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "库房深处忽然传来一阵铜铃声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4111,
          "end": 4111
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是外面的风铃，而是木匣内部的铃。最靠墙的一只小匣自行打开，露出一张被折成四层的旧纸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4113,
          "end": 4113
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离展开纸张。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4115,
          "end": 4115
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "纸上画着三盏灯和一座城门。第一盏灯旁写着“玄霄”，第二盏灯旁写着“顾氏”，第三盏灯旁却没有名字，只有一道空白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4117,
          "end": 4117
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城门下方标着一行日期：冬至前七日。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4119,
          "end": 4119
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏灯没有经手人。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4121,
          "end": 4121
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“或者经手人的名字已经被拿走。”叶观澜答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4123,
          "end": 4123
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "纸张背面还有一行小字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4125,
          "end": 4125
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“若第二盏灯回到人间，第三盏灯将寻找未偿债者。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4127,
          "end": 4127
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离猛地抬头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4129,
          "end": 4129
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它在找我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4131,
          "end": 4131
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "话音落下，库房外传来脚步声。脚步很轻，却带着玄霄宗短靴特有的金属碰撞。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4133,
          "end": 4133
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜吹灭手中火折：“有人跟来了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4135,
          "end": 4135
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临将两枚残印分开，藏进不同的衣袋。掌心残印在黑暗里发出微光，照见薄册最后一页多出一行新字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4137,
          "end": 4137
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾长离，第二次点灯候选。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4139,
          "end": 4139
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看见那行字，脸色终于变了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4141,
          "end": 4141
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不会点。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4143,
          "end": 4143
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果它逼你呢？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4145,
          "end": 4145
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就毁掉灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4147,
          "end": 4147
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“毁灯会让城塌。”叶观澜提醒。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4149,
          "end": 4149
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“城塌，总比让它拿走更多名字好。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4151,
          "end": 4151
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "库房门被撞了一下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4153,
          "end": 4153
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "玄霄宗弟子的声音从外面传来：“顾长离，交还顾氏旧印。陆照临，交还两枚残印。宗门只追究主犯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4155,
          "end": 4155
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把薄册塞进怀里：“他们把我算作从犯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4157,
          "end": 4157
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临拔出短刀：“你要走哪条路？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4159,
          "end": 4159
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她指向库房后方：“旧库有一条运灯道，通往北境雪原。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4161,
          "end": 4161
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你记得？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4163,
          "end": 4163
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我记得入口。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4165,
          "end": 4165
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“里面呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4167,
          "end": 4167
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“进去之后再想。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-074",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4169,
          "end": 4169
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯的光，从石阶尽头照来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-076",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4173,
          "end": 4173
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临将残印按向地面。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-078",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4177,
          "end": 4177
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“西坡旧阵、归墟灵城、顾氏封存工程。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4245,
          "end": 4245
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这些都已经封存。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4247,
          "end": 4247
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临带走了两枚残印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4249,
          "end": 4249
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋将证词纸折好：“所以你们终于想起要问。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4251,
          "end": 4251
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "亲传弟子皱眉：“你参与过三年前的删史。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4253,
          "end": 4253
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我参与过记录整理。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4255,
          "end": 4255
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把三个人的名字从名册上裁掉，也叫整理？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4257,
          "end": 4257
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们的名字已经被太虚秩序取走。留在纸上，只会让更多人被牵连。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4259,
          "end": 4259
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁决定取走？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4261,
          "end": 4261
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋抬眼：“当时所有人都同意。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4263,
          "end": 4263
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏同意了吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4265,
          "end": 4265
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏有人同意，有人拒绝。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4267,
          "end": 4267
        }
      }
    ],
